Ohio State all lost to unranked teams in a year where parity is the ever present theme.","published":"2026-11-22T06:41:33.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/page/gamedayfinal112126/week-12-top-games-highlights-takeaways","type":"Story","byline":"Kyle Bonagura","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Predicting the College Football Playoff: Who's most likely to make the field?","description":"Find out which teams our experts think will make this season's CFP.","published":"2026-11-22T06:30:41.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/page/playoffpredictions112126/cfp-predictions-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN Staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"College Football Playoff top 12 projection after Week 12","description":"We assess how the selection committee could stack the top teams in the country after Week 12.","published":"2026-11-22T07:00:30.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50552244/projecting-2026-playoff-top-12-week-12-cfp","type":"Story","byline":"Heather Dinich","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Which teams have the best odds to make the College Football Playoff?","description":"We are tracking the odds for making the CFP, earning a bye and winning it all.","published":"2026-11-22T05:08:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532919/college-football-playoff-odds-predictions","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Nebraska's jab at Ohio State's 'THE' leads top Week 12 CFB trolls","description":"Nebraska deployed a simple but effective troll that poked fun at its opponent's propensity to emphasize the \"the\" in \"The Ohio State University.\"","published":"2026-11-22T04:22:49.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50554531/nebraska-ohio-state-trolls-college-football-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Georgia clinches SEC title game berth with win at South Carolina","description":"Nate Frazier ran for 94 yards and two touchdowns, and No. 1 Georgia clinched a spot in the final SEC championship game with a victory over South Carolina on Saturday night.","published":"2026-11-22T05:47:52.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50558713/georgia-clinches-sec-title-game-berth-win-south-carolina","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios for Week 12?","description":"Here's what teams from every conference would need to play for their league championship.","published":"2026-11-22T04:00:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512475/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Miami tops Virginia Tech, to face Wake Forest in ACC title game","description":"Miami will play Wake Forest in the ACC title game on Dec. 5 after both teams won on Saturday.","published":"2026-11-22T04:46:52.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50558418/miami-tops-virginia-tech-face-wake-forest-acc-title-game","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Betting buzz: Big Ten's odds of national champion four-peat getting slim","description":"Losses by UCLA, Indiana and Ohio State make the Big Ten's chances of winning the national championship this season a long shot.","published":"2026-11-22T04:06:20.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/49921234/college-football-betting-buzz-odds-updates-line-moves-spreads","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Emotional Greg Schiano authors 'special' win, Rutgers' first at PSU since 1988","description":"Less than two weeks after Rutgers announced embattled Greg Schiano would return as coach for a 19th season, the Scarlet Knights stunned Penn State 25-24 on Saturday, their first win over the Nittany Lions since 1988, and just their third this year.","published":"2026-11-22T02:56:26.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50557643/rutgers-authors-special-win-1st-penn-state-1988","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4833626/ben-roberts","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ben_Roberts_(linebacker)"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Ben Roberts (linebacker)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ben_Roberts_(linebacker)","description":"American football player (born 2004)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:37:26Z","intro":"Ben Roberts (born February 28, 2004) is an American football linebacker for the Texas Tech Red Raiders.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Roberts attended V.R. Eaton High School. He committed to play college football for the Texas Tech Red Raiders."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Roberts used the 2022 season to redshirt. In week two of the 2023 season, Roberts made his first career start, where he notched 12 tackles with two being for a loss, half a sack, and a forced fumble in a loss versus Oregon. He finished the 2023 season, recording a team-high 107 tackles with six and a half being for a loss, half a sack, an interception, and two forced fumbles. For his performance during the 2023 season, Roberts was named to the FWAA freshman all-American team, while also being named the Big 12 Defensive Freshman of the Year. He finished the 2024 season, notching 83 tackles with four and a half going for a loss. In week eleven of the 2025 season, Roberts brought in an interception in a victory versus Kansas State.\nTeaming up at linebacker with Big XII defensive Most Valuable Player Jacob Rodriguez, Roberts led the Red Raiders to a 34–7 win over BYU in the conference championship game on Dec. 6 at Cowboys Stadium. Roberts tallied two interceptions in the second half and was named the game’s MVP."}]}}